          <div class="step-rule">⏱ Wait time: 60 seconds — most important wait of your routine</div>
          <p class="step-desc">This is the treatment step — where the real work happens. Serums contain the highest concentration of active ingredients (Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Retinol, Hyaluronic Acid) in the thinnest carrier. The 60-second wait after applying ensures full penetration before you layer anything on top and block absorption.</p>
          <p class="step-desc"><strong>AM serum:</strong> Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Antioxidants. <strong>PM serum:</strong> Retinol, Peptides, AHA/BHA. Never mix Vitamin C and Retinol in the same routine.</p>
          <div class="step-products">
            <span class="prod-chip">Minimalist 16% Vit C (AM)</span>
            <span class="prod-chip">TO Niacinamide 10% (AM/PM)</span>
            <span class="prod-chip">The Ordinary Retinol (PM only)</span>
            <span class="prod-chip">Neutrogena Rapid Firming (PM)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-tip">💡 One serum at a time: If you're a beginner, use ONE serum per routine. More than two serums at once reduces efficacy and increases irritation risk.</div>
