          <div class="step-rule">⏱ Wait time: none — tap gently and continue</div>
          <p class="step-desc">The skin around your eyes is 40% thinner than the rest of your face — it needs its own dedicated product. Eye cream goes before moisturizer because its formula is specifically calibrated for that delicate area. Apply with your ring finger — it has the lightest natural touch — using gentle tapping, never rubbing.</p>
          <div class="step-products">
