          <div class="step-rule">⏱ Wait time: 2 minutes before SPF (important!)</div>
          <p class="step-desc">Moisturizer seals everything you've applied before it — locking in serums and preventing transepidermal water loss throughout the day or night. It also fortifies your skin barrier, which is your primary defence against irritation, breakouts, and premature aging. Apply to slightly damp skin for 30% better absorption.</p>
