          <p class="step-desc">The absolute final step of every morning routine — no exceptions. SPF is not optional, not skippable on cloudy days, not replaceable by "SPF in my foundation." A dedicated sunscreen with SPF 50 PA++++ is the single most anti-aging, anti-pigmentation product in existence. Everything before it protects your skin. SPF protects everything before it.</p>
