          </div>
          <div class="step-rule">⏱ Wait time: none</div>
          <p class="step-desc">PM cleansing is more important than AM. You're removing sunscreen, pollution particles, excess sebum, and makeup — all of which clog pores if left overnight. If you wore SPF (you did), double cleansing is recommended: oil cleanser first to break down sunscreen, then water-based cleanser to clean the skin underneath.</p>
          <div class="step-products">
            <span class="prod-chip">DHC Deep Cleansing Oil (1st cleanse)</span>
            <span class="prod-chip">CeraVe Foaming (2nd cleanse)</span>
            <span class="prod-chip">Banila Co Clean It Zero (1st cleanse)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-tip">💡 Skip double cleanse if: You didn't wear SPF or heavy makeup that day. A single gentle cleanser is perfectly sufficient.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num-col">
          <div class="step-circle c2">2</div>
          <div class="step-emoji">💦</div>
