          <div class="step-rule">⏱ Wait time: none — this is your final step</div>
          <p class="step-desc">Your PM moisturizer can be richer and more occlusive than your AM version — at night you don't need to worry about SPF compatibility or makeup sitting on top. A sleeping mask 2–3 times per week adds an extra occlusive layer that dramatically boosts overnight hydration and supports barrier repair.</p>
